	(text_box "\"The BNO08X supports environmental sensors (e.g. pressure sensors, ambient light sensors) on a secondary\nI2C interface. This interface should be pulled up via resistors regardless of the presence of the external\nsensor as the SW polls for sensors at reset.\""
